## What this licence does not cover

It covers the contents of this repository and nothing else. Everything Evie
talks to has its own terms, and they are not affected by this document:

- **The language model.** It is not distributed here, is downloaded separately,
  and is governed by its own licence.
- **The inference server**, the voice engine, and any other third-party
  component, each under its own licence.
- **Apple's frameworks and operating system.**
- **Your own data.** Nothing in this licence gives anyone any right to your
  notes, mail, calendar or files. Evie runs on your machine and this repository
  receives nothing from it.

